llowing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123641#pullrequestreview-5270692015","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123641","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123641#pullrequestreview-5270692015"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123641"}},"submitted_at":"2026-09-21T19:04:54Z","commit_id":"3671a569494724634aa83d00fb5ca11e0b36c04f"},{"id":5275897558,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOnfO1g","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?u=b7882c94f408976a2f79e8fe6e1ce27fbd48db74&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Optimizing using `depth` can yield great benefits. However `depth` is not generally available, you can only rely on it if both nodes are in the (same) scene tree.\r\n\r\nWith the current approach this PR breaks duplication of scenes outside of the tree:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _run() -> void:\r\n\t# Just two nodes\r\n\tvar scene: PackedScene = load(\"res://dupl_scene/s.tscn\")\r\n\tvar inst = scene.instantiate()\r\n\r\n\t# Uncomment this to make it work.\r\n\t# EditorInterface.get_base_control().add_child(inst)\r\n\tinst.get_children()[0].editor_description = \"test2\"\r\n\t\r\n\t# Will print a bunch of errors and won't have the new editor description.\r\n\tvar copy = inst.duplicate()\r\n\tprint(copy.get_children()[0].editor_description)\r\n\t\r\n\tinst.queue_free()\r\n\tcopy.queue_free()\r\n```\r\n\r\n(Also this is a hole in our test suite.)","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123641#pullrequestreview-5275897558","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123641","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123641#pullrequestreview-5275897558"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123641"}},"submitted_at":"2026-09-22T08:46:33Z","commit_id":"62f8105ad37594bd7dac240231e410c93bf6c218"}]